              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "QjsW0",
                  "name": "Heading",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "I’m Khaled. I work on what’s left when building gets cheap.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.06,
                  "fontFamily": "$serif",
                  "fontSize": 72,
                  "fontWeight": "500",
                  "letterSpacing": -1.6
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qwipm",
                  "name": "Para 1",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "I’m a solution architect in Cairo, with more than ten years of building software.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.46,
                  "fontFamily": "$serif",
                  "fontSize": 25,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qKxkZ",
                  "name": "Para 2",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "AI now does much of the building. The hard part has moved to people: deciding what to build, checking what was built, and learning from what shipped.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.46,
                  "fontFamily": "$serif",
                  "fontSize": 25,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "V2RaH",
                  "name": "Para 3",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "So I run Mindcache, an async practice that helps software teams change how they work now that AI makes building cheap. It finds where work waits, installs a few changes at a time, and measures each one against the team’s own baseline.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.46,
                  "fontFamily": "$serif",
                  "fontSize": 25,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r04iM",
                  "name": "Para 4",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "I write things down, which is how most of my open work started. When I couldn’t find the word for something, I wrote a protocol for it.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.46,
                  "fontFamily": "$serif",
                  "fontSize": 25,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
